    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct completion",
      "source_hash": 15686909637088739208,
      "context_hash": 8832891872924955183,
      "translation": "struct completion",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`completion` is a simple one-shot synchronization primitive: one thread waits, another signals when done.",
      "source_hash": 7967397938980207256,
      "context_hash": 11327629112983226383,
      "translation": "`completion`은 단순한 일회성 동기화 프리미티브입니다. 한 스레드가 대기하고, 다른 스레드가 작업을 마치면 신호를 보냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It's simpler and safer than using `wait_queue_head_t` directly for this common pattern.",
      "source_hash": 1025376985711067160,
      "context_hash": 2490538133677106044,
      "translation": "이러한 일반적인 패턴에서는 `wait_queue_head_t`를 직접 사용하는 것보다 더 간단하고 안전합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Completion variants",
      "source_hash": 3789915126521167212,
      "context_hash": 18217818082679123585,
      "translation": "Completion 변형",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Completion with try_wait",
      "source_hash": 6221152326117560028,
      "context_hash": 1739295849571477947,
      "translation": "try_wait를 사용하는 completion",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
