      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "wait_event: the standard pattern",
      "source_hash": 4923418722441266607,
      "context_hash": 13908470348582555018,
      "translation": "wait_event: 표준 패턴",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`wait_event` combines the wait with a condition check:",
      "source_hash": 12491458249381076505,
      "context_hash": 1863120158582894604,
      "translation": "`wait_event`는 대기와 조건 검사를 결합합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**The wake_up / wait_event contract**:",
      "source_hash": 7381304995795799048,
      "context_hash": 7810021359010730920,
      "translation": "**wake_up / wait_event 계약**:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`wait_event` uses a loop:",
      "source_hash": 16186334566578482948,
      "context_hash": 16416130835923541006,
      "translation": "`wait_event`는 루프를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "This correctly handles races: if the condition becomes true between the check and `schedule()`, the wake_up will have set the task state back to TASK_RUNNING.",
      "source_hash": 17280222984169190550,
      "context_hash": 14043989605843330805,
      "translation": "이 방식은 경쟁 조건을 올바르게 처리합니다. 검사와 `schedule()` 사이에 조건이 참이 되면, wake_up이 태스크 상태를 이미 TASK_RUNNING으로 되돌려 놓았을 것이기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Custom wait: prepare_to_wait / finish_wait",
      "source_hash": 1358487754973966286,
      "context_hash": 14112328727684949966,
      "translation": "사용자 정의 대기: prepare_to_wait / finish_wait",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For more complex patterns:",
      "source_hash": 1877417367568649245,
      "context_hash": 16286484269770102447,
      "translation": "더 복잡한 패턴의 경우:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Exclusive waiters",
      "source_hash": 14678372196550925101,
      "context_hash": 2729373377517113049,
      "translation": "배타적 대기자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Exclusive waiters are woken one at a time (thundering herd prevention):",
      "source_hash": 12436514509925580879,
      "context_hash": 6546292748726932059,
      "translation": "배타적 대기자는 한 번에 하나씩 깨어납니다(thundering herd 방지).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Used for accept() on TCP listen sockets: only one of many waiting accept() calls needs to be woken when a connection arrives.",
      "source_hash": 10641807307161066904,
      "context_hash": 17213117519754586082,
      "translation": "TCP listen 소켓의 accept()에 사용됩니다. 연결이 도착하면 대기 중인 여러 accept() 호출 중 하나만 깨우면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "poll/select/epoll integration",
      "source_hash": 1402481803953202567,
      "context_hash": 11097594014933076785,
      "translation": "poll/select/epoll 통합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Drivers implement `poll` (or `->poll` in file_operations) using wait queues:",
      "source_hash": 8351518338718513450,
      "context_hash": 7563234522556944090,
      "translation": "드라이버는 대기 큐(wait queue)를 사용하여 `poll`(또는 file_operations의 `->poll`)을 구현합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queues": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:27:56.397773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`poll_wait` adds the wait queue to the poll table so that epoll monitors it.",
      "source_hash": 2910056057238548185,
      "context_hash": 8984401429175187641,
      "translation": "`poll_wait`는 epoll이 대기 큐를 감시할 수 있도록 대기 큐를 poll 테이블에 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:27:56.397774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "When `wake_up` fires, epoll wakes the calling process.",
      "source_hash": 14671499612779875058,
      "context_hash": 11950713468294865432,
      "translation": "`wake_up`이 발생하면 epoll이 호출한 프로세스를 깨웁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:22.227775Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
